### 8. **Pipeline Integration**

**File**: `/home/serhii/.vadd/worktrees/a2300d77-2915-456c-a5cc-7896c3517ae6/f9ceb523-035f-474c-97ac-a479f8a5a582/backend/app/Services/AuditReport/AuditPipeline.php`

