```The plan has 8 tasks. Key design choice: rather than touching all 8 call sites with identical try/catch boilerplate, the plan introduces a `RenderSafeMailer` service — a thin wrapper around `Mail::to()->send()` that adds structured `Log::error` on render failure (mailable class name + recipient + exception) before rethrowing. Each non-audit call site switches from `Mail::to()->send()` to `$this->mailer->send()`, gaining coverage in one line.

The `AuditMailer` path is left untouched — it already has render-failure logging with test coverage.

